{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52329","headline":"诗（幷序） 九十 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 九十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敬他保自贵，辱他□□□（戴补「招自耻」，吕朋林补「实辱己」。\n张补「还自受」三字，不韵，恐非是。\n）。\n你若敬（项校「计」，下同）算他，他还敬算你。\n勾他一盏酒，他勾十巡至。\n子细审思量，此言有道理。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}